#, no-c-format
msgid "Your Personal Data"
msgstr "Jou Persoonlike Data"

#. i18n: file certificatewizard.ui line 227
#: rc.cpp:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On this page, you will enter some personal data that will be stored in your "
"certificate and that will help other people to determine that it is actually "
"you who is sending a message."
msgstr ""
"Op hierdie bladsy sal jy sommige persoonlike data invoer wat gestoor sal word "
"in jou sertifiaat en wat ander mense sal help om te bepaal dat dit werklik jys "
"wat 'n boodskap stuur"

#. i18n: file certificatewizard.ui line 255
#: rc.cpp:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Insert My Address"
msgstr "Voeg My Adres in"

#. i18n: file certificatewizard.ui line 258
#: rc.cpp:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will insert your address if you have set the \"Who am I\" information in "
"the address book"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie sal jou adres invoeg indien jy die \"Wie is ek\" inligting in die "
"adresboek opgestel het"

#. i18n: file certificatewizard.ui line 304
#: rc.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decentralized Key Generation"
msgstr "Desentraliseerde Sleutel Generasie "

#. i18n: file certificatewizard.ui line 323
#: rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>On this page, you will create a key pair in a decentralized way.\n"
"</p>"
"<p>You can either store the certificate request in a file for later "
"transmission or \n"
"send it to the Certificate Authority (CA) directly. Please check with \n"
"your local help desk if you are unsure what to select here.</p>"
"<p>\n"
"Once you are done with your settings, click \n"
"<em>Generate Key Pair and Certificate Request</em> in order to generate your "
"key pair and a corresponding certificate request.</p>\n"
"<p><b>Note:</b> if you choose to send via email directly, \n"
"a kmail composer will be opened; you can add detailed information for the CA\n"
"there.</p><qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Op hierdie bladsy sal jy 'n sleutelpaar in gedesentraliseerde wyse skep.\n"
"</p>"
"<p>Jy kan óf die sertifikaat versoek in 'n lêer stoor vir latere transmissie "
"of\n"
"dit na die Sertifikaat Outoriteit (SO) direk stuur.  Kontak asseblief met\n"
"jou plaaslike hulpstasie as jy onseker is wat om hier te kies.</p>"
"<p>\n"
"Wanneer jy klaar is met jou verstellings, kliek \n"
"<em>Genereer Sleutelpaar en Sertifikaat Versoek</em> "
"ten einde jou sleutelpaar en  ooreenstemmende sertifikaat versoek te "
"genereer.</p>\n"
"<p><b>Nota:</b>as jy kies om 'n e-pos direk te stuur,\n"
"sal 'n kpos samesteller oopgemaak word;  jy kan daar gedetailerde inligting "
"byvoeg vir die SO\n"
"</p><qt>"

